{#
  STT name hints: the names the player is likely to say, sent to speech-to-text with each
  push-to-talk and open-mic utterance (STT.yaml name_hints, on by default) so they come back
  spelled right. Local Whisper reads this as text heard just before the speech; hosted services
  take it as their prompt, and Fateless also gets each listed name that this text contains as a
  keyword.

  Keep it short and plain. The rendering is held to 500 characters (the lowest-ranked names are
  dropped until it fits), line breaks become spaces, and Whisper copies the style of what it
  reads. Render nothing to send no hints.

  Variables, each a list of names with the most likely first:
  - characters: nearby characters (followers first), the player, pinned characters
  - places: where the player is (location, hold, interior, worldspace), then nearby map markers
    and door destinations
  - nearby_characters, pinned_characters, current_places, nearby_places: one kind each
  - player_name: the player's name ("" when it was dropped)
  - names: every name, in rank order
#}
{% if length(characters) > 0 %}{% for name in characters %}{{ name }}{% if not loop.is_last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.{% endif %}
{% if length(places) > 0 %}{% for place in places %}{{ place }}{% if not loop.is_last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}.{% endif %}
